# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] Non-root             Configured UID >= 1000$
$
  User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
  [george]$
$
  [ ] Sudo                 Enabled, No password$
   -  SSH Keys             7 keys$
   -  UID:GID              1000:1000$
   -  Directory            /home/george$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure sudo, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Configure a new user$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-2 or q]:$

